---
description: Detect a pasted Plan Contract, a structured brief, or a feature request written in prose, and route it before executing anything
alwaysApply: false
---
Follow `.claude/skills/brief-detection/SKILL.md` when the user's message has structured H2 markers
(Goal, Milestones, Atomic Sub-tasks, etc.), or, in the main folder, asks in a few sentences to build,
add, change, fix or remove something in the product. A pasted Plan Contract must go through
`save-plan` before any work starts, not straight into execution; a brief or a feature request gets
the skill's a/b/c gate (a: the Architect + PM review, b: `/plan`, c: discussion). See `docs/agent/workflow-map.md` §9 for the known race between this gate and save-plan.
